    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197510/extras/c17907ea3850e3de4e1c06b107d8253a.avif?t=1668578643\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Easy-To-Use Music Creation Tool</h2>We offer a simple and clear set of tools for creating music, with over 20 built-in tones of varying characters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ultimate Beginner Guide to Music Composition</h2>To get you to write your first song, here are 8 music theory lessons.<br>Ditch the hard and obscure book theory, let's learn by doing!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playing Your Song With Animal Bands</h2>Each tone is played by a specific animal, and after you finish your song - perform with the band!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197510/extras/c17907ea3850e3de4e1c06b107d8253a.avif?t=1668578643\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Easy-To-Use Music Creation Tool</h2>We offer a simple and clear set of tools for creating music, with over 20 built-in tones of varying characters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ultimate Beginner Guide to Music Composition</h2>To get you to write your first song, here are 8 music theory lessons.<br>Ditch the hard and obscure book theory, let's learn by doing!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playing Your Song With Animal Bands</h2>Each tone is played by a specific animal, and after you finish your song - perform with the band!",
    "short_description": "Bon! Music is an ultimate beginner guide to music composition. Create your first song in 48 hours, start from here!",
